        "date": "2026-11-22T11:05:05Z"
      },
      "message": "Merge upstream/main into issue/2769-manual-guide-blank (reconcile with #3307)\n\nMain has the Manual Guide i blank writer and the StockShape PARAM\ncontract from PR #3307. This merge keeps that writer and that contract.\nIt drops the duplicate StockBlank contract of this branch: the PARAMs,\nthe stockBlank manifest flag, the engine filter (post::stock_blank) and\nposting_stock_blank.rs.\n\nWhat stays from this branch:\n- the option help names the Series 30i background-simulation unit limit;\n- pins: the shape PARAMs keep the line map and trace record indices on\n  the input stream; a bar with the origin above its top posts no G1900.\n\nRefs #2769\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
